WEBVTT

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:07.812
In this video, you will claim a home that is already on the map, so your own photos and details replace the automatic listing.

00:00:07.812 --> 00:00:12.037
You need to be signed in to do this, and in this video we already are.

00:00:12.037 --> 00:00:13.061
We start on the map.

00:00:14.036 --> 00:00:15.710
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:18.576 --> 00:00:21.126
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:23.018 --> 00:00:23.998
Then tap Allow.

00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:31.749
Say you spot your own home on the map, listed from a public list of homes.

00:00:31.749 --> 00:00:34.425
Search for your street, and open your home's card.

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:40.999
Homes we found on public lists have a link at the bottom of the card.

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:42.310
Tap Is this your home?

00:00:44.097 --> 00:00:44.821
Claim it.

00:00:45.777 --> 00:00:51.078
The form opens with your address already filled in, and tells you which listing you are claiming.

00:00:51.078 --> 00:00:52.874
Tap A homeowner, then Next.

00:00:55.143 --> 00:00:58.602
Type the name to show, like the Park family, then tap Next.

00:01:00.735 --> 00:01:03.676
If a company installed your lights, you can name them here.

00:01:03.676 --> 00:01:06.194
We did it ourselves, so tap No, then Next.

00:01:08.466 --> 00:01:10.063
Tap Christmas, then Next.

00:01:12.378 --> 00:01:14.655
The name is filled in from the listing.

00:01:14.655 --> 00:01:18.515
Change it if you like, and tell families what makes your lights special.

00:01:18.515 --> 00:01:19.634
Then tap Next.

00:01:22.003 --> 00:01:23.139
Check the address.

00:01:23.139 --> 00:01:25.361
It is already filled in, so just tap Next.

00:01:27.012 --> 00:01:29.830
Telling families when your lights are on is optional.

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:30.701
Tap Next.

00:01:32.352 --> 00:01:35.279
Add photos of your own lights, taken at night.

00:01:35.279 --> 00:01:37.789
They replace the picture on the automatic listing.

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:43.255
Finally, check everything, and tap Put it on the map.

00:01:45.214 --> 00:01:51.074
Your home usually goes live at once, and it replaces the automatic listing at that address.

00:01:51.074 --> 00:01:55.701
If it is held for a quick check, it goes live once the site owner has looked it over.

00:01:56.572 --> 00:01:57.435
That is it.

00:01:57.435 --> 00:02:04.055
Your home usually goes live at once, and it replaces the automatic listing, with your own photos and details.

00:02:05.399 --> 00:02:07.638
Next up: Feature your event or home.
